     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: pangloss<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=487398<br/>\nOriginator: NO</p>\n\n<p>Fixed in svn maintenance-2.2 branch (rev 6003).</p>\n\n<p>Details: <br/>\nsrc/java/fedora/utilities/install/FedoraHome.java, line 114, now reads:<br/>\ndbPoolName = \"localPostgreSQLPool\";</p>",
